Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，戳戳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,448行星上的原住民反抗十分猛烈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据报告我军已经坚持不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就赶快增加兵力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛…别的星球也需要用兵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只有很少的兵力可以差遣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶，撤退，赶快撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是索尔贝，怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到那美克星人的幸存者了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分抱歉，索尔贝大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已投入大量的间谍摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然一无所获
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啧，看来还是得去地球吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球…可是那里很危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个有办法找到龙珠的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个超级赛亚人的同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到那美克星人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只能去一趟地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且根据间谍摄像机获取的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到龙珠的人似乎不只有那个女的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有其他人也有办法找到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔格玛，我们两个去一趟地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，不过只有我们两个人去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说地球上的赛亚人不需要用探测器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能察觉到强大的战斗力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去的人太多反而会被察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此，我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人，您要亲往地球吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了，这关系到弗利萨大人的复活啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人，找到了，是这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经找到几颗龙珠了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，赶快行动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要赶在这些家伙集齐之前抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？最后一颗就在这里吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是的，应该就在正下方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下不好办了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偏偏这里的大海又很深
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔格玛，跳进海里找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小舞！都怪你不快点用龙珠雷达来找
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才害得我们的龙珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被这些莫名其妙的宇宙人抢走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮拉夫大人强硬一点，拒绝他们不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事已至此，就用你的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和修的刀唰唰唰地干掉他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？皮拉夫大人不一起战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来就是负责出谋划策的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次就勉为其难吧，上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别以为我个子小就好欺负
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不敢不敢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大人饶命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉，花的时间有点长了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，阿包，让你久等了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看短笛叔叔一身绿皮肤，其实很温柔吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那个方向感觉到了不详的气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…是什么人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，快开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事…事成之后，不会把我们都杀掉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定以后还要用到你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么？你不相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，岂敢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我男朋友的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是特兰克斯喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话，快开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出…出来吧，神龙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现我们的愿望吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天黑了，难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是神龙吗？在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快，说出你的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论任何愿望我都能实现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请…请讲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人，快许愿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让弗利萨大人复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《复活的弗利萨》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是什么愿望都能实现吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是，这个人的肉体已经在很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就被切得四分五裂，不能复原了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只让他的灵魂归体也没有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下不好办了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人，即使肢体破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要用我军的最新型再生装置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定还是可以复活的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？是啊，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，肢体破碎的状态也没关系，快让他复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好大的口气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请…请让弗利萨大人复活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没办法，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，许下一个愿望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？下一个愿望？你能实现两个愿望？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，地球的神更替的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强化了我的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个…两个吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不让弗利萨大人的爸爸也一起复活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我100万钱币！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你这臭小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔贝大人，我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别惊动那些赛亚人为好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得宇宙船上有冷冻保存装置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快拿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是弗利萨大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这强劲的生命力加上我军的技术，一定能复原
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不久之后我们还会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时会和弗利萨大人以及将士们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮，修
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笨啊，怎么不干脆要一亿钱币？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多要一点岂不是更好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，有了这笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少暂时不愁吃喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去吃文字烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要布丁！布丁，布丁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.99,0:11:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有不详的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 大屠杀 武力镇压 独裁主义者 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 谈笑间碾压一切 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 拉兹那 惨遭抛弃 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 夷大人 不堪一击 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 狰狞残暴的多利亚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 长发披肩的萨 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 强硬的臂膀 Pink Pink Pink ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 脑海中满是 Sick Sick Sick ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 浮游的 Vehicle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 战斗力53万 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 深陷迷宫的历史 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 没有秩序 尽是侵略 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.78,0:12:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 正义 七颗宝珠 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 罗曼蒂克 Give Me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 将一切炸成灰烬 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 引出那蝼蚁之辈 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 探测器 疯狂闪动 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 现在 让你们见识下 我真正的面貌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 神一般的变身 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 后悔也为时已晚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 天崩地裂 地动山摇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 皮开肉绽 伤痛难耐 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 天崩地裂 大气翻滚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那震动正是黑暗袭来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 弗利 弗利 弗利 弗利 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 波动 大洞 银河 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 大意 陷阱 寄生虫 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 弗利 弗利 弗利 弗利 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 胆怯哭泣的子民们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我们盼您复活盼得很久了，弗利萨大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？你是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在…在下名叫索尔贝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前是第3星域的参谋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，我对你有一点印象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在代弗利萨大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,统帅全军
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,统帅是你？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我真的复活了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，依靠龙珠和新型再生装置
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙珠？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，就是那美克星人制造的奇妙的珠子吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没能找到那美克星人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我和塔格玛前往地球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用了地球的龙珠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下就是塔格玛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨大人此次复活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下也尽了一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下是西萨米
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两位战士十分优秀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以匹敌已故的萨博大人和多多利亚大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，辛苦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来，为了让我复活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们花了相当长的时间嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十…十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为寻找龙珠和准备再生装置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花费了相当多的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在地球的地狱里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是吃尽了苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把您请回来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，反正我不在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干什么都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才想到让我复活的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不，绝无此事…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，虽说花了不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也因此研发出新型的再生装置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才让您的身体完美复原
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们只能让弗利萨大人您复活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的父王要等下一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，用不着让爸爸复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不惯他那副自以为是的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵…遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的功力有些退步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能要花些时间再去复仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复…复仇？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两个超级赛亚人把我害得这么惨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不干掉他们，我的气没法消
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,属下觉得招惹他们并不明智
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不如像以前一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索…索尔贝大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔格玛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防护罩！快打开防护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在的这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨军真是威严扫地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区区几个赛亚人搞得宇宙第一的弗利萨军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊慌失措，还怎么工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不过，那个叫孙悟空的赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在…在那之后又…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说又变强了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然难以启齿…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我没料到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我变得比他更厉害就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙连魔人布欧都打败了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且在那之后的情报也没有取得
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔人布欧…爸爸嘱咐过我，千万不要对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏神比鲁斯和魔人布欧出手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的就是那个魔人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还真是超出了我的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，很有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有…有意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是天才
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前从没有修炼过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有修炼的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底会变得多厉害呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我修炼一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把潜在能力全部引发出来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您…您是说还能变得更厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我的预测
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真修炼四个月的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少能让战斗力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先达到130万吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是超级精英银河巡逻队的队员
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要让我说几次？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把布尔玛叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您还不明白吗，没有事先约好的话没法见您
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货，我特意赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了告诉你们地球要大难临头了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，这不是渣克吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是渣克，是加克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你看看我可爱的金鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，好大的眼睛，像艾尔卡星人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫做凸眼金鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样，很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点忘了！快把布尔玛叫来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，真的是加克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真是好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这次来做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的姐姐塔依丝告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和打败弗利萨的男人是朋友，真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？啊，打败弗利萨的有两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一个是我的儿子特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个是我的朋友孙君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说是儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是乘坐时光机从未来而来的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的儿子还是个小少爷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未来…你还真敢说…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操控时间在银河法里可是重罪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不知道还有那种法律
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点让我见你那个朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事情要告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不太好办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在和我丈夫去了比鲁斯大人那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比鲁斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亏你还是银河巡逻队的，连他都不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是破坏神比鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏神比鲁斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比鲁斯只是神话里的人物而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不信就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没时间说闲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨复活了，正带着1000个士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝地球而来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？弗利萨，就是那个在那美克星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我吃尽苦头的弗利萨？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，我不知道他长什么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙就是弗利萨？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说他复活了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着1000个士兵？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有言在先，我要躲得远远的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我还年轻，还不想死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么严重的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维斯先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维斯先生！这个是草莓圣代喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃的话就快回话喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不快点就化了喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么紧迫的时候你还在搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能快点联系上他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加克，弗利萨什么时候到地球？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约1小时后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋！没时间了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点通知大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！快过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！我们是富翁了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了，大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.53,0:22:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋！别乱动！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙，我要提速了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶！真是难缠的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你还追得上吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太危险了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「太危险了」？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险的…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.26,0:23:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做强盗就是这个下场
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我们吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？是布尔玛小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，我是小林
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛小姐，怎么这时候打电话？我正上班呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？弗利萨？怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.86,0:23:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，好，我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上准备
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来联系武天老师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.72,0:24:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨…复活了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.39,0:24:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比你们的战斗力要高得多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.23,0:24:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是在这里保护玛伦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.24,0:24:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，想麻烦你一个事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我剃头…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.99,0:24:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空和贝吉塔去了比鲁斯那里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.25,0:24:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，听说还在等回信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.32,0:24:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他们能早一点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还有悟饭在，可以放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.77,0:24:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要抵达地球了，弗利萨大人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，听说把我打倒的赛亚人里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.86,0:24:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只找到了孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.11,0:24:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，弗利萨大人去世后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.81,0:25:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就立刻展开了搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而无论怎么找都找不到另一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.70,0:25:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是去了别的星球，或是已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在地球上的赛亚人应该只有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空、贝吉塔还有孙悟空的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.38,0:25:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.05,0:25:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，就算弗利萨大人成功复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.63,0:25:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还是会靠龙珠复活的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.79,0:25:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就顺便把地球毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.34,0:25:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙珠和那里的地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也都会消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.98,0:25:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原…原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.98,0:25:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有，你要谨记以防万一的那个作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽…尽管放心
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.99,0:25:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.93,0:26:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，花儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.10,0:26:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有工夫愣神？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶！敢耍我！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特！你到底在瞄准哪里！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔，你怎么怪我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.21,0:26:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我退下！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.87,0:26:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次让我一个人来打
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.67,0:27:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破绽百出
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动…动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于捉住你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.53,0:27:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，停一下，停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.62,0:27:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.94,0:28:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度还差得很远
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.71,0:28:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看，我都有时间签名了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，你什么时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两人的行动还是依赖大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别是贝吉塔先生，你这一点非常明显
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.47,0:28:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做的话速度是有极限的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.48,0:28:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从五感和大脑通过神经
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.47,0:28:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反应到身体上是需要花费时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.55,0:28:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔这方面确实很明显啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不多考虑只是因为笨而已
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体的各个部位能自然而然地做出判断
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.31,0:28:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反应到行动上的话是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.58,0:28:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是做到这一点十分困难
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.74,0:28:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连比鲁斯大人都还没有完全掌握呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能克服这个缺点，无论任何危机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都能够化险为夷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.29,0:28:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也罢，还是多花一些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢教你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.93,0:28:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用美食当学费
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就能做到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过维斯先生，你踩到大便了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞋是不会自然而然地判断的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.69,0:29:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，贝吉塔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.70,0:29:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本来是一个战斗天才
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却总是落后悟空先生一步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.55,0:29:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啧，说…说得真直接
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.72,0:29:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.89,0:29:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你平时一直紧绷着神经
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.39,0:29:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一到关键时刻，你无法用出全力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.89,0:29:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该放松的时候就该好好地休息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.23,0:29:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像悟空先生那样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.89,0:29:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得没错啊，贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.99,0:29:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.49,0:29:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼！你干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松过头也是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对自己太过自信也是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再强的人，一旦放松了警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.66,0:30:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体也会不堪一击
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.34,0:30:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现你经常因为过度自信而疏忽大意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.01,0:30:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你怎么这么说啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.43,0:30:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干什么呢？好吵啊，害我都睡不着了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.11,0:30:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真…真危险
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.19,0:30:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被刚才那下打中可就完了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.62,0:30:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比鲁斯大人一犯困就会那样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.63,0:30:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有次把那两个太阳都破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围漆黑一片，出了好大乱子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.88,0:30:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是怎么把太阳变回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.62,0:30:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有创造星球的能力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.97,0:31:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，遇上这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就会让一切重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.31,0:31:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新来过？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.89,0:31:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是稍微让时间倒流
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.15,0:31:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在比鲁斯大人做傻事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.45,0:31:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻地教训他一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.82,0:31:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是何方神圣？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.68,0:31:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该如何回答呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.82,0:31:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概就是叫做维斯的生命体吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.24,0:31:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，还真是拿比鲁斯大人没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.90,0:31:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直都是那副样子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.00,0:31:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来，比鲁斯大人都完全不愿意听我唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂！你们怎么在这儿？  - 这样啊，比鲁斯大人还真过分啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那个，比鲁斯大人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.91,0:31:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在让维斯先生指导我们修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.09,0:31:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我当然能看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.29,0:31:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是问你们怎么来到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.46,0:31:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们呼唤了维斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.05,0:31:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他带我们一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.02,0:31:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们感觉不到你们的气
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.43,0:31:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只能这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.69,0:31:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维斯吗？哼，要是我没猜错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.01,0:31:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是用美食引诱了他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.73,0:32:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.87,0:32:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么这么执着于变强？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会是想当破坏神的后继者吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦，我只想变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是不想被这小子抢先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.71,0:32:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两位还真是水火不容啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.45,0:32:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你们联手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.35,0:32:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定还能和比鲁斯大人势均力敌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别多嘴，维斯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁死也不愿和这种家伙联手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.90,0:32:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是不介意搞好关系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过战斗的时候还是想一个人去打
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是够了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.64,0:32:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.32,0:32:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.57,0:32:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你们带来的是什么美食
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.74,0:32:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，这次是叫做披萨的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.91,0:32:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这名字挺有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.08,0:32:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不会全吃光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把比鲁斯大人的份都留着了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.92,0:32:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就来尝尝好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:33:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你们刚才打扰我睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.09,0:33:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是这东西不好吃的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.12,0:33:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是会灭了你们喔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.35,0:33:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热一下更好吃，我去去就来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.52,0:33:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，维斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.58,0:33:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才说「这次是」
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.52,0:33:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你们不是第一次来这里了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.78,0:33:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.92,0:34:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北都的附近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.85,0:34:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面给我让一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.73,0:34:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只算是稍微打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.78,0:35:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋已经动手了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.23,0:35:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没带饺子和饮茶来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一战似乎比较危险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说布尔玛阿姨严令禁止把这个事情
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.85,0:35:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉特兰克斯和悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.49,0:35:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让他们总喜欢乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.41,0:35:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思，我们来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.25,0:35:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绕路去了趟加林塔取仙豆
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.01,0:35:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.24,0:35:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这光头真令人怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧，我这次可是鼓足了干劲
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来，悟饭你怎么这身打扮？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这个嘛，事出突然所以没能找到道服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.60,0:36:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭啊，你有继续修炼武术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.02,0:36:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.85,0:36:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我想大概还能变身成超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.45,0:36:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空还没来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.53,0:36:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他…他很快就会来的，再等一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.45,0:36:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，是你啊，我记得好像取过你的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是用龙珠复活的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.79,0:36:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙珠？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.45,0:36:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果…果然是那个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.40,0:36:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫…莫非
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.72,0:36:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在那个圆形装置里的就是弗利萨吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.16,0:36:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到你还挺有绘画天赋嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛小姐，你怎么跑到这种地方来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.66,0:37:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我完全联系不上孙君和贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.70,0:37:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不得已才会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.33,0:37:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你也下来一起战斗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要，我早说过了只是送你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛，你不是高傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.33,0:37:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级精英银河巡逻队队员吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.29,0:37:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我负责对付周围那群敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.02,0:37:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢，布尔玛小姐可是有不少奇怪的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.69,0:37:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，还以为是超级赛亚人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.19,0:37:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看那个标志原来是银河巡逻队的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.95,0:37:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你啊！真够纠缠不休的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.40,0:37:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么复活的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.20,0:37:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨…笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.07,0:37:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话别这么刺耳！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.54,0:37:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，你认识我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.38,0:37:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你也去过那美克星吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.38,0:37:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友孙悟空先生上哪儿去了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛，事到如今还来找他复仇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.31,0:37:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这边出了很多状况，所以拖到这么晚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.31,0:38:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的孙君一定能轻松战胜你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.56,0:38:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不你还是趁早回去比较好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.90,0:38:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛，别去挑衅他了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.47,0:38:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他赶回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.43,0:38:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是看到自己的朋友们都被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.07,0:38:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必会很懊恼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.99,0:38:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，你肯定能打赢他吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.75,0:38:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些士兵应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.83,0:38:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，布尔玛阿姨也许没看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.28,0:38:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.34,0:38:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经和以前判若两人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.49,0:38:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的力量变强太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.59,0:38:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以很抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？怎…怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.10,0:38:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.04,0:38:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙君出远门了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.60,0:38:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你再稍微等一会儿，拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.69,0:38:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一刻我也等了很长时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.36,0:38:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再等十秒左右
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.36,0:38:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十…十秒？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.11,0:38:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛，太小气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.37,0:39:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵们！去干掉他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.13,0:39:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.17,0:39:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，我们上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人负责…我看看…大约170个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要坚持到悟空和贝吉塔回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟派气功！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.84,0:39:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.44,0:40:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.67,0:40:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去形势不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.38,0:40:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分散开！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.31,0:40:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然号称弗利萨军但毕竟是些乌合之众
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.72,0:40:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.91,0:41:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着地
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.83,0:41:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来还是有困难
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.43,0:41:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气功炮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.47,0:41:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟…派…气…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都不懂得尊老吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.27,0:41:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,功！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.97,0:42:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气圆斩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.37,0:42:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.35,0:42:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混蛋干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.10,0:42:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也有份
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.77,0:43:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下轻便多了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.15,0:43:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.53,0:43:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙真是纠缠不休
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.98,0:43:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你了，悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.69,0:43:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:43:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气，你没事吧，小林叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.86,0:44:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去去就来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.76,0:44:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.76,0:45:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不知道你是谁，挺厉害嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想问你们是什么来历呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.71,0:45:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.36,0:45:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？那你太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.59,0:45:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且脸也长得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要你管！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.36,0:45:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.60,0:45:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.20,0:45:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好意外的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.20,0:45:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他们痛下杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.23,0:45:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有孙悟空的儿子一个人就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.98,0:45:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概一瞬间就能解决
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.29,0:46:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是故意坚持着不伤人性命的战斗方式
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.46,0:46:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟他父亲一样，真是善良
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.13,0:46:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空可是连我这个极恶之人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.45,0:46:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不愿下杀手的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.13,0:46:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的人格是多么高尚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.91,0:46:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让我恶心！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.64,0:46:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨大人，索尔贝大人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.67,0:46:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也准备去参战了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.06,0:46:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.72,0:46:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙交给我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.59,0:46:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔贯光杀炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.76,0:46:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.27,0:47:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.12,0:47:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔，让我来对付他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.28,0:47:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.17,0:47:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连西萨米都被打败了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.81,0:47:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你没有亲眼见识过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.90,0:47:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不是很理解超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.77,0:47:53.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正可怕的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.15,0:47:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到孙悟空的儿子也能变身了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.07,0:47:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.36,0:48:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.36,0:48:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于轮到他本人出马了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀，虽然我早料到会是这种结果
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.24,0:48:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过弗利萨军还真是大不如前了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.84,0:48:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.01,0:48:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.79,0:48:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他…他们比我们想象中还要难对付
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.43,0:48:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我倒是不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.34,0:48:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.94,0:48:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都倒在这儿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.47,0:48:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会很碍眼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.03,0:48:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！快离远点！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真…真是可怕的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.55,0:49:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大家果然都挺厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.04,0:49:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过最危险的家伙还没解决
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.39,0:49:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.71,0:49:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们银河巡逻队之间也是个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.56,0:49:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是异常强大的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.23,0:49:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我当然知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.09,0:49:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么还待在这里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.48,0:49:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来正是紧要关头啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.60,0:49:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.85,0:49:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是已经大显身手了一番嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.15,0:49:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我能和邪恶的帝王弗利萨对抗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.74,0:49:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我可得拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.86,0:49:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.57,0:49:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们五个人一起上，能有胜算吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.42,0:49:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，我们打不过他的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.67,0:49:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个怪物和我们不是一个级别的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.93,0:49:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你也这么觉得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.17,0:49:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.01,0:49:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就是不肯攻过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.93,0:49:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等得无聊了，要不按顺序一个个杀死你们？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.44,0:50:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是孙悟空先生的儿子吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.39,0:50:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都长这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.62,0:50:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.70,0:50:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.63,0:50:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来也敌不过现在的我了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.88,0:50:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，悟饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.30,0:50:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了，他的心脏停止跳动了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.97,0:50:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下没办法让他吃仙豆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.14,0:50:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.81,0:50:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.98,0:50:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，真让我感到惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.31,0:50:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们似乎拥有着不可思议的药物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.57,0:50:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，你们究竟能争取到多少时间呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还剩下几颗仙豆？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.00,0:50:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩一颗了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.02,0:51:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.02,0:51:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个很有弹性的东西叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.27,0:51:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想，叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.69,0:51:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.76,0:51:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对，就是奶酪！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.81,0:51:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西虽然有股怪味，味道却很独特
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.95,0:51:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比鲁斯大人，别为了这种小事打扰我们练功啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.29,0:51:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.53,0:51:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢对着我这个破坏神
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.82,0:51:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此出言不逊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.63,0:51:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我好好记着，你们居住的地球没被我破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.80,0:51:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为那里有美味的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.55,0:51:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我懂了，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.81,0:51:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，维斯，你也该注意到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.06,0:51:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久之前就有一封来自地球的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.15,0:51:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.43,0:52:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.76,0:52:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人找我了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.65,0:52:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定又是布尔玛小姐发来的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.64,0:52:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想告诉我有什么好吃的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.24,0:52:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然没错…哦，草莓圣代吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来非常豪华而且很好吃的样子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.03,0:52:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想尝尝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.92,0:52:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试试和她取得联络
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.67,0:52:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点，维斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.67,0:52:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.87,0:52:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个叫做草莓圣代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.45,0:52:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一种甜点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.51,0:52:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！维斯先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.68,0:52:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.00,0:52:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回复得太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.02,0:52:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔和孙君在那边吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.25,0:52:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们马上回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.80,0:52:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个最坏的混账弗利萨复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.80,0:52:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在地球很危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.36,0:52:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混…混账？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.61,0:52:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？弗利萨？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.28,0:52:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.60,0:52:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说，弗利萨怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.87,0:52:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了，马上让维斯先生带我们过去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.20,0:52:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约要花35分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.04,0:53:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等不了那么久！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.29,0:53:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙君！你会瞬间移动吧，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.88,0:53:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是，距离太远了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.49,0:53:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定无法感应到地球那边的气
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.97,0:53:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨的气比较强，应该能感应到吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.47,0:53:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！孙君要瞬间移动
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.29,0:53:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把气提升到最大！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.98,0:53:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶…喔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.72,0:53:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.74,0:53:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在呼唤他，那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.77,0:53:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感应到了！喂，贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.19,0:53:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么？要我和你牵手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.91,0:53:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.28,0:53:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定布尔玛会被杀的！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.38,0:53:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她总是嘴巴不饶人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.42,0:53:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，我们走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.10,0:53:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.10,0:54:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶上了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.52,0:54:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，再晚一点就危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.52,0:54:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在千钧一发的时候才来，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.43,0:54:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿，抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.77,0:54:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是等了很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.04,0:54:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过没想到贝吉塔先生也在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.37,0:54:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向你复仇的这一刻终于到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.30,0:54:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来真的是弗利萨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.33,0:54:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么复活的？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.05,0:54:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们用了龙珠
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.37,0:54:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约半年前
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.22,0:54:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.31,0:54:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的地狱是名副其实的地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.73,0:54:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被剥夺了力量，像结草虫似的被吊起来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.06,0:54:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在天使和妖精们的森林里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.40,0:54:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被吊在一片空旷的花田中
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.68,0:54:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候还要被迫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:54:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看可爱的布娃娃跳舞游行
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.66,0:55:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.19,0:55:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是多么痛苦的事吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.08,0:55:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.16,0:55:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己擅自跑来地球
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.25,0:55:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会被特兰克斯杀掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.46,0:55:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你活在这世上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.91,0:55:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直让我难受得睡不着觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.60,0:55:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以，这次复活之后
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.27,0:55:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不再被你打败
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.38,0:55:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我经过了一番修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.27,0:55:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做这种努力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.35,0:55:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我有生以来第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.19,0:55:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实，你的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.77,0:55:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎又提高了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.48,0:55:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你有没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.69,0:55:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也变得更强了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.46,0:55:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前确实是我掉以轻心了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.79,0:55:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我要一口气变成最终形态！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.00,0:56:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.84,0:56:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是怎么修炼的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.76,0:56:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这下危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.79,0:56:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，大家，再离远一点吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.52,0:56:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然不简单啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.94,0:56:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不是一个彻头彻尾的坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.63,0:56:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来是一个不错的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.86,0:56:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.27,0:56:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的话一如既往地令我烦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.45,0:57:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，你不变成超级赛亚人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.71,0:57:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不变也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.55,0:57:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，看来挺有自信嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.22,0:57:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.71,0:57:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，那么开始我的复仇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.13,0:58:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害，面对这么强劲的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.91,0:58:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空一下都没被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.46,0:58:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直像在做一场恶梦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.33,0:58:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有那么强大的地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.80,0:58:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实他是赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.47,0:58:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛亚人？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.09,0:58:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该已经灭绝的战斗民族为什么会在地球上？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.98,0:58:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在那边的我的丈夫也是赛亚人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.73,0:58:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？真…真是吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.51,0:59:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事就当做没听过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.32,0:59:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球归我管辖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.18,0:59:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种麻烦事不好处理
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.85,0:59:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一招！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.55,1:00:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.41,1:00:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子，适可而止吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.65,1:00:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说好了轮流战斗吗！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.75,1:00:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛～
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.78,1:00:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到时间吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.26,1:00:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他…他们在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.67,1:00:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.93,1:00:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对我还抱有一点忠诚心吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.18,1:01:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许插手，贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.60,1:01:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来的目的是打倒孙悟空先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.95,1:01:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看？再打一会儿就换你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.61,1:01:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.88,1:01:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.66,1:01:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说确实已经过了很久
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.13,1:01:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的实力能提升这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.08,1:01:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还真没想到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.05,1:01:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不是说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.30,1:01:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我修炼过了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.71,1:01:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你还隐藏着什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.73,1:01:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.89,1:01:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，你也是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.68,1:01:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都拿出全部实力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.93,1:01:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再留一手了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.82,1:01:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，请你先来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.32,1:01:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗？你会失去斗志喔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.33,1:01:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让你见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.17,1:02:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们下来了，要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.46,1:02:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.79,1:02:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果还是超级赛亚人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.66,1:02:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.25,1:02:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个解释起来有点麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.64,1:02:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是拥有超级赛亚人之神的力量的赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.08,1:02:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成的超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.47,1:03:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸亏我做了准备，真是好险
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.23,1:03:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了以防万一，我修炼出了新的进化形态
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.34,1:03:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是明智
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.07,1:03:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要故弄玄虚了，快点让我见识一下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.95,1:04:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉…厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.79,1:04:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.11,1:04:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让变化一目了然，变成了金色
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.79,1:04:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是不是太简单了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.21,1:04:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然是个庸俗的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.13,1:04:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫黄金弗利萨吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.38,1:04:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，我可不是仅仅改变颜色
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.46,1:04:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你心里明白
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.38,1:04:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这让我很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.00,1:04:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到你能强到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.98,1:04:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都有点紧张了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.48,1:04:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来谁输谁赢还不一定呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.40,1:04:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.64,1:04:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.99,1:04:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要换你上？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.98,1:04:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少…少来这套虚情假意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.90,1:04:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨是冲着你来的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.03,1:04:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就试试吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.63,1:07:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.71,1:07:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比…比鲁斯大人，维斯先生！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.38,1:07:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛小姐，我们来品尝草莓圣代了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.14,1:07:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带来了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.14,1:07:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？倒是带来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.64,1:07:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很好吃吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.63,1:07:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们特意从很远的地方赶来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.98,1:07:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不好吃就毁掉这里
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.32,1:07:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是吃东西的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.49,1:07:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知…知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.44,1:07:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有点融化了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.29,1:07:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不小心用力过猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.19,1:07:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，请用
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.59,1:08:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来似乎很好吃嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.28,1:08:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.61,1:08:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦哦，这个的主体是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.73,1:08:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前吃过的冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.20,1:08:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西看起来像玛努星的大型青蛙的大脑
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.61,1:08:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种果实吗？水嫩又爽口
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.88,1:08:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好吃啊维斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.38,1:08:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经在吃了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.55,1:08:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯～虽然成分简单
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.62,1:08:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过真是一份美味的甜点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.66,1:08:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来，弗利萨那家伙的实力提升不少啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.56,1:08:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空先生陷入苦战了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.56,1:08:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎～布尔玛小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.09,1:08:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个白色的东西不是冰激凌吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.72,1:08:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是鲜奶油
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.40,1:08:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔果然不和他一起战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.40,1:08:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明两人联手就赢定了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.31,1:08:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两个人绝对不会联手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.06,1:08:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为自尊心太强了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.94,1:08:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.19,1:08:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和您一样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.51,1:09:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙啊，我现在处在下风
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.44,1:09:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.77,1:09:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然是高手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.72,1:09:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我达到现在这个水平
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.31,1:09:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是花了相当多的时间呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你哭着求饶也没用喔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.12,1:09:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你的顽强精神我表示赞赏
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.12,1:09:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟你只是个赛亚人而已
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.62,1:09:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我要让你粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.29,1:09:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太…太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.92,1:09:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比…比鲁斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.09,1:09:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么，弗利萨，你直呼我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.93,1:09:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比…比鲁斯大人，您为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.84,1:09:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看了不就知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.63,1:10:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吃这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.27,1:10:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您…您不会阻拦我的复仇吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.60,1:10:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.77,1:10:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.99,1:10:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过稍微离这边再远点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.31,1:10:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灰尘会弄脏美味的甜点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.49,1:10:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不会出手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.15,1:10:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了随便你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.44,1:10:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是破坏神
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.00,1:10:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不站在任何一边
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.79,1:10:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你不帮我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.51,1:10:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决斗就是决斗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.17,1:10:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢你！大家会被杀掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.47,1:10:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.21,1:10:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心，既然你给我好吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.02,1:10:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就只保护你一个人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.00,1:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我身边待着
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.69,1:10:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，那真的是破坏神比鲁斯吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.82,1:10:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.19,1:10:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以和他合个影吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.56,1:10:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己去问他就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.02,1:10:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说不定会被他消灭
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.20,1:10:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那，还是算了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.66,1:11:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，继续我的复仇吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.24,1:11:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要打吗？带着胜利的好心情
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.95,1:11:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样离开比较好喔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.17,1:11:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟你好不容易才复活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.22,1:11:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我会放弃近在眼前的胜利离开吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.72,1:11:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特，我可以换你下来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.17,1:11:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真狡猾
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.63,1:11:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也发现了吧，弗利萨的弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.19,1:11:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弱点？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.14,1:11:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.60,1:11:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过刚才的战斗你应该明白
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.37,1:11:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会有弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.32,1:11:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然现在还没有显露出来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.58,1:11:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.21,1:11:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被复仇心冲昏头脑
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.71,1:11:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚修炼出那个所谓黄金弗利萨的进化形态
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.26,1:11:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跑来了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.93,1:11:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.60,1:12:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的体力消耗太快了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.06,1:12:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本应该多花点时间修炼
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.84,1:12:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,习惯了这个形态再来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.43,1:12:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.94,1:12:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，我就抓紧时间杀掉你吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.94,1:14:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.55,1:14:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如他们所说，攻守的形势开始逆转了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.89,1:14:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.92,1:14:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个草莓是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.43,1:14:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说！你吃了几个？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.06,1:14:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.60,1:14:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃了两个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.44,1:14:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，您吃了四个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.43,1:15:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草莓本来有八个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.07,1:15:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行吗？我可是神
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.59,1:15:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟…派…气…功！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.64,1:15:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不算什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.99,1:15:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.81,1:16:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看？正如我刚才所说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.02,1:16:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再劝你一次
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.47,1:16:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.32,1:16:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次我会再和你较量
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.51,1:16:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混…账！为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.03,1:16:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.54,1:16:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.75,1:17:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得很好，索尔贝
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.38,1:17:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您的夸奖！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.09,1:17:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好准备了这个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.92,1:17:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防万一的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.78,1:17:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.15,1:18:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡午觉的时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.93,1:18:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀，明明提醒过他
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.76,1:18:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然做法卑鄙，弗利萨这家伙还是赢了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.70,1:18:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天真就是你的弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.04,1:18:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你因为太强大了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.66,1:18:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反而疏忽大意
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.64,1:18:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的坏毛病喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.10,1:19:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么强健的肉体
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.30,1:19:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然被区区激光枪打倒
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.02,1:19:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.36,1:19:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是令人惋惜
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.14,1:19:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来胜利在望
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.43,1:19:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果却输掉了这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连做梦都在期盼的这一刻终于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.71,1:19:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，就这样杀掉你也没什么乐趣
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.55,1:19:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔先生
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.83,1:19:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把动手的机会让给你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.51,1:19:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.29,1:19:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你心中憎恨这个赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.75,1:19:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像以前那样，向我展示你的忠诚心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.19,1:19:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会只放过你一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.24,1:19:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.57,1:19:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.41,1:20:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞…搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.24,1:20:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明刚被维斯提醒过
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.87,1:20:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说你是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.59,1:20:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得的机会，很可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.59,1:20:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙虽然令人作呕
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.12,1:20:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是对我的修炼还有用处
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.76,1:20:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.98,1:20:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.89,1:20:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我任命你为弗利萨军的最高司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.44,1:20:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然现在军队里只剩索尔贝一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.90,1:20:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，重新召集人手就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.99,1:20:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？最高司令官，没骗我吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.46,1:20:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.28,1:20:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶…真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.75,1:20:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.96,1:20:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经决定了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.15,1:20:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把你彻底消灭
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.09,1:20:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.59,1:20:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你毁灭了我的家乡贝吉塔行星
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.02,1:21:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么可能对你有忠诚心
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.14,1:21:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，毁灭贝吉塔行星那件事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.54,1:21:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时比鲁斯大人也是赞成的吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.94,1:21:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘！闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.31,1:21:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，小林
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.68,1:21:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给卡卡罗特吃仙豆
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.84,1:21:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他快死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.32,1:21:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦…哦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.61,1:21:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.49,1:21:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.34,1:21:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，悟空，打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.13,1:21:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好刚才有人不要仙豆
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦贝吉塔，得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.09,1:21:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.88,1:21:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的果实就归我了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.01,1:21:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，换人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.50,1:22:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能打败我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.85,1:22:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？你不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.57,1:22:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能变成
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.51,1:22:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.05,1:23:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你心里也清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.34,1:23:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不像那家伙那样天真
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.60,1:23:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.46,1:23:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区区贝吉塔，竟敢口出狂言！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.94,1:23:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.84,1:23:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.11,1:24:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经完了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.49,1:24:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也别想复活了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.11,1:24:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也一样！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.63,1:24:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.52,1:24:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕，喂，维斯
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.15,1:24:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.39,1:25:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.89,1:25:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球…地球被…！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.26,1:25:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝吉塔…特兰克斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.73,1:25:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有爸爸和妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.81,1:25:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.81,1:25:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让整个地球跟着陪葬了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.74,1:25:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，恐怕弗利萨并没有死
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.04,1:25:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.91,1:25:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙在宇宙空间里也能生存
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.03,1:25:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，让他得逞了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.75,1:25:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混账…那个混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙珠也被毁掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.66,1:25:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都无法复原了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.05,1:25:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.17,1:25:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我早点把他收拾掉就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.77,1:26:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，要去收拾他吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.60,1:26:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.94,1:26:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的天真导致的结果
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.94,1:26:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去把弗利萨送回花田吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.28,1:26:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.08,1:26:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，我要让时间倒流了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要快点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.49,1:26:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多只能回到三分钟前
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.96,1:26:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？难…难道
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.80,1:26:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，重新来过
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.34,1:26:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.22,1:26:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.45,1:26:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经完了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.83,1:27:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也别想复活了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.11,1:27:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也一样！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.67,1:27:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗利萨！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.84,1:27:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.69,1:27:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可恶！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.61,1:27:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.38,1:27:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特，你干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.72,1:27:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这个，贝吉塔，抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.66,1:27:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.96,1:27:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管什么原因
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.31,1:28:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明明说了换我上！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.89,1:28:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用生气啊，贝吉塔！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.23,1:28:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙君救了你和地球喔～
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.13,1:28:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.47,1:28:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事，给我说清楚！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.65,1:28:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀，真是不成体统
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.87,1:28:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏神居然让星球重生
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.28,1:28:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会为你们两位
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.53,1:28:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备一大堆好吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.09,1:28:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过先要用龙珠把北都复原
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.08,1:28:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.12,1:28:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逆转时间就是为了这个
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不逮捕他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.96,1:28:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操控时间是重罪吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.10,1:28:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.78,1:28:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么，我可不会感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.47,1:28:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们互不相欠了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.95,1:28:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦，贝吉塔
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.52,1:29:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们像维斯先生说的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.48,1:29:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一开始就联手
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.24,1:29:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会导致这样的危机了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.91,1:29:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我们是不是应该偶尔联手？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.65,1:29:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看还是免了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.62,1:29:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了，我也这样想
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.37,1:29:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总算看法一致了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.24,1:29:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 真丢人啊！失败不可忍！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.03,1:29:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 绰绰有余的样子真烦人！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.70,1:29:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 大家都在议论纷纷 拯救了地球的那个人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.29,1:29:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 腾云驾雾 又是上新闻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.84,1:29:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 还有那满不在乎的口吻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.71,1:29:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 疏忽大意就是天敌 说说让他注意分寸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.43,1:29:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ (可要准备好喽) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.81,1:29:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 身为主角的你 在你看来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.89,1:29:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你的立场到底是什么呀？敢问前辈！ (哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.39,1:29:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 等你认真起来也太晚了！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.36,1:30:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 太把战斗来当作乐趣！ (哈 哈 哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.90,1:30:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在这千钧一发危急关头 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.86,1:30:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 别再随意的乱开玩笑啦！让人担心！ (哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.07,1:30:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一旦悲剧就此发生 总仰望着你的我们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.16,1:30:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 还能学习谁的“勇气”？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.58,1:30:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 以为未来理所当然 没想到那么易碎 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.33,1:30:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 当一个人明白这一点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.04,1:30:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 他自然就会重生 变成一个战士 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.51,1:30:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 首先应该要去守护的 是心中盛开的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.30,1:30:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那小小的梦想 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.93,1:30:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 好让它 不会被黑暗销毁殆尽 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.85,1:30:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 守护得住吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.39,1:30:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使你会迷茫 这是任务 TEAM "Z" ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.24,1:30:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 合起双手来 把气集中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.04,1:30:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 总有天 发出龟派气功 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.79,1:31:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 往往发出的是叹息 掀起的却是一张纸巾 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.29,1:31:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 当你无法如愿以偿 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.96,1:31:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么嘛 咬了咬指甲 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.72,1:31:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我们都为你加油！上吧！说教的第四条！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.51,1:31:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ (忍耐一会儿吧) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.97,1:31:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 偶尔与你切磋 迎面而来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.89,1:31:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你是故意被我打中的吧？对吗前辈！ (哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.44,1:31:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 实在让人太过提心吊胆！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.36,1:31:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 害得我一下心跳过快！ (哈 哈 哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.94,1:31:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 过着与众不同的人生嘛 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.90,1:31:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 到了周末 一定会整个人筋疲力尽！ (哈) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.12,1:31:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 然而这张永不变的 天真孩子气的笑脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.20,1:31:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 正是那勇者的证明 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.33,1:31:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 以为未来理所当然 没想到那么易碎 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.13,1:31:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 当一个人明白这一点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.84,1:31:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 他自然就会重生 变成一个战士 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.34,1:31:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 首先应该要去守护的 是心中盛开的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.10,1:31:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那小小的梦想 其实它… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.56,1:32:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就是那叫做『Z』的誓言… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 所有守护未来的人 会被称为英雄 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.08,1:32:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在我们的这个星球上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.79,1:32:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 爱和希望一定 能够永存下去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.17,1:32:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 下一次可要轮到我了 那小小的梦想 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.01,1:32:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一定要守护它 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.55,1:32:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 好让它 不会被黑暗销毁殆尽 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.51,1:32:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 守护得住吗？ ∮
